Description: Scrape and load hockey play-by-play data and statistics.
    Sources include the National Hockey League (NHL) <https://www.nhl.com/>
    web, stats, 'NHL Edge' tracking and records application programming
    interfaces (APIs), the Professional Women's Hockey League
    <https://www.thepwhl.com/>, and the American Hockey League, Ontario
    Hockey League, Western Hockey League and Quebec Maritimes Junior Hockey
    League through their 'HockeyTech' feeds. It also reads NHL data from
    'ESPN' and 'Fox Sports', National Collegiate Athletic Association
    (NCAA) men's and women's hockey from 'ESPN', and 13 European leagues:
    Germany's Deutsche Eishockey Liga (DEL), Austria's International
    Central European (ICE) Hockey League, the United Kingdom's Elite Ice
    Hockey League (EIHL), Denmark's Metal Ligaen, the Kontinental Hockey
    League (KHL), Russia's Supreme Hockey League (VHL), the Swedish Hockey
    League (SHL) and HockeyAllsvenskan, Finland's Liiga, Switzerland's
    National League and Swiss Ice Hockey Federation competitions, Czechia's
    Extraliga and France's Ligue Magnus. Loaders read pre-scraped
    play-by-play, box score, schedule and expected-goals datasets from the
    'SportsDataverse' data releases.
